# Line endings (decision 2026-10-02): every text file is LF in the repository and in the
# working tree, whatever the local core.autocrlf setting. Windows batch files are the one
# exception and stay CRLF. tests/test_line_endings.py enforces this on the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary: never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.ico binary
*.lnk binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite3 binary
